  <item>
    <title>06.奥运之光-祝我们永远鲜活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cefa3056bfd3907ab693c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cefa3056bfd3907ab693c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Aug 2024 10:21:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当夏日的热浪与奥运的激情相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们迎来了一场全球瞩目的体育盛宴</span></p><span></span><p><span>从射击队的神枪手到泳池里的飞鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>从乒乓球桌上的较量到举重台上的力量展现</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们喜欢竞技体育这个实力与运气缺一不可的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢追求肾上腺素飙升带来的快感</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一位运动员都以自己的方式诠释着奥运精神</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们一起见证了运动员那些在赛场上闪耀的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span>⭐这些奥运之光</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡照亮了我们平淡的现实生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝 我们永远鲜活</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 因为忙着看奥运，所以没空录播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 中国队创境外奥运会最高战绩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 射击队网名多样、稳定淡定的00后们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 印象最深的一场乒乓球比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 包揽冠军，横扫金牌🏅的项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 突破电视台尺度的名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 创造历史的运动项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 总有一些意难平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a> 有实力还努力，个性鲜明的运动员们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a> 奥运会帅哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 马龙，不止巴黎见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 奥运会初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> 人们为什么喜欢看奥运会，奥运会带给我们什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Oh The Larceny——《This is it》</span></p><span></span><p><span>AJR——《Let the Games Begin》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sia——《Unstoppable》</span></p>]]></description>
