  <item>
    <title>03.是谁说“什么年纪就该干什么事儿”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6661a42563c334a2fbd2b887</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6661a42563c334a2fbd2b887</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jun 2024 11:57:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「社会时钟」这个概念最初由心理学家Neugarten提出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Neugarten认为，同一个集体的人们，会用一种共享的社会节奏来衡量自己的生活，比如什么时候应该结婚，什么时候应该找到第一份工作，而这种共享的社会节奏就是我们所说的“社会时钟”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们的“个人时钟”没有按照“社会时钟”的速率和方向前进的话，我们会面临怎样的困扰和压力？面对这些压力，我们能做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客，让我们来共同寻找答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 新嘉宾来咯！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 什么是“社会时钟”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 在“社会时钟”下，人们面临着怎样的压力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 进入“社会时钟”就没有后顾之忧了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 一个经典的排序问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a> 怎样面对焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家在自己的时区里，自在，安宁。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp8J7pk9NRIuYtR40csKnAUfju2l.m4a" length="76909534" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6DRa50DHfoiSROy67gwtDvph5X.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02.MBTI之安心做个混合I、E人吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661ff5645dae7932c62cc6bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661ff5645dae7932c62cc6bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你做MBTI测试了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是E人还是I人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这似乎正在成为一张流行的社交名片……</span></p><span></span><p><span>有的E型人，偷偷做I</span></p><span></span><p><span>有的I型人，为I做E</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果足够精确的话，</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个人的I，E比例都应该是不同的吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你我其实都是独一无二的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>希望我们都不需要执着于“成为更好的自己”</span></p><span></span><p><span>而是自在地“更好地成为自己”~</span></p><span></span><p><span>勇敢做E做I！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> &nbsp;本播客第一位神秘嘉宾——从事中医行业的八爪烧老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> &nbsp;I和E具体指什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> &nbsp;MBTI究竟是I是E，一起来做个测试吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> &nbsp;综艺明星居然以I人居多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> &nbsp;I人去到陌生环境，居然会主动和人交谈？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> &nbsp;E人因为E属性而受伤的时刻......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> &nbsp;拜托，我开心最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> &nbsp;“为I做E”、“窝里E”这些MBTI网络热词，你有听过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">38:41</a> &nbsp;E人说他们没有不想理任何人的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> &nbsp;真的有“假E真做”这种情况吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> &nbsp;中医说性格会遗传？那双胞胎为什么性格会不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> &nbsp;I人和E人受伤程度和恢复状况大不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2814">46:54</a> &nbsp;本具自足，我就是我，不一样的烟火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> &nbsp;书桓走的第一天......</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:大张伟——《只为自己开的花》（电影《热辣滚烫》热辣希望曲）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsUmS0z9ihyFJtzgkpc_cxlO86cN.m4a" length="50962232" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZydWxLSXpZSEpoeEdHQ1ptWjJpWG5YM2V4S04ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
